sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant Storefront
    participant Catalog
    participant Pricing
    participant Inventory
    participant Reviews
    participant Orders
    actor Admin
    Customer->>Storefront: Browse, search or open direct model URL
    Storefront->>Catalog: Page (24 models) or direct model + bounded similar row
    Storefront->>Pricing: SKU price batches (at most 100)
    Storefront->>Inventory: Availability batches (at most 100)
    Storefront->>Reviews: Published summary batch + model reviews
    Storefront-->>Customer: Photos, exact variants, prices, demo/verified badges
    Customer->>Storefront: Restore cart or wishlist
    Storefront->>Catalog: Resolve saved SKU batches independently of current page
    Customer->>Storefront: Choose own order and write a review
    Storefront->>Orders: Customer-owned order list and selected order
    Storefront->>Reviews: Customer review submission
    Reviews->>Orders: Verify owned delivered product/SKU purchase
    Reviews-->>Storefront: PENDING
    Admin->>Reviews: Publish or reject with audited operation
    Storefront->>Reviews: Refresh published list and summaries
    Reviews-->>Storefront: Consistent published aggregate; private identities omitted
